lopment-which-folders-to-exclude-for-windows-defender\n\nAdditionally, in the Godot project folder \"android\", is it better if the folders are no longer monitored by Windows Defender?\n\n---------------\n\nand that?\n> or disable the 'safe save' option in editor settings. This makes it work, but increases the risk of file corruption in a crash.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a7bdeb6-5ecd-4ceb-b343-fff9051de4f2)\n\n\n\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2746358239/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]